WEBVTT

00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:07.300
Mouse is looking for a new home.

00:00:11.500 --> 00:00:15.800
This house looks nice.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:24.300
Come and sleep with me.

00:00:28.500 --> 00:00:32.800
Mouse has a muddy dream.

00:00:37.000 --> 00:00:41.300
Parrot says, come and sleep with me.

00:00:45.500 --> 00:00:49.800
It is too noisy here.

00:00:54.000 --> 00:00:58.300
Fish says, come and sleep with me.

00:01:02.500 --> 00:01:06.800
It is cold and wet here.

00:01:11.000 --> 00:01:15.300
Mouse wants a warm, dry home.

00:01:19.500 --> 00:01:23.800
Look! It is warm near the fire.

00:01:28.000 --> 00:01:32.300
Here is a little space for Mouse.

00:01:36.500 --> 00:01:40.800
Now Mouse has cosy dreams.

00:01:45.000 --> 00:01:49.300
Good night, little mouse.
